Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library, the decoder only.

Source:   https://github.com/mstorsjo/fdk-aac
Commit:   c41c3c7516ea8d0d78a53b96b30bed3a29745cc6
Licence:  NOTICE (Software License for The Fraunhofer FDK AAC Codec Library for Android),
          also in LICENSES/FDK-AAC.txt

Kept: the libraries the decoder links (libAACdec, libArithCoding, libDRCdec, libFDK,
libMpegTPDec, libPCMutils, libSACdec, libSBRdec, libSYS): their headers and the sources the
upstream CMakeLists.txt lists for the decoder (sources.txt). Left out: the encoders, xHE-AAC,
the tools, the documentation and the build files. No file is changed.

AWTRIX NG builds it as the static library awtrix_fdkaac (cmake/FdkAac.cmake) and decodes radio
streams with it (src/core/radio/stream/AacDecoder.cpp). Patents: the licence grants none; see
docs/guides/radio.md.
